              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘટના — ghaṭnā — \"an incident; an event\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પત્રકારે આખી ઘટના લખી. patrakāre ākhī ghaṭnā lakhī. The journalist wrote down the whole incident."
            },
