        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘટના (ghaṭnā) is a tatsama, Sanskrit ghaṭanā, \"taking effect, a coming together\" (Monier-Williams); in Gujarati it is something that happens, the word of reports: આખી ઘટના, the whole incident."
            }
          ]
